title: The second operation
view-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.pending(Q)==='cyprus_atilla2_14'; !}
new-page: true

= 14 August 1974 — The second operation

Turkey has authorized a second operation. Today's decision determines the strength of the next military position; its result remains uncertain.

Historical source reference:

The silence was broken by the message from the war centre in Adana:

“...Unless changed, the operation will begin with the first light. Objective: the Şahin Line. Password: VICTORY.”

In the darkness of the night, the great war machine immediately began turning. Soldiers were put into tanks and armoured vehicles. Orders were repeated.

Mehmet Ali Birand, Diyet, PDF page 19 — English translation of the source excerpt.

- @historical: Continue the offensive towards the operation's objectives.
- @alternative: Prioritize reinforcement and supply coordination before the next advance.

@historical
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.pending(Q)==='cyprus_atilla2_14'; !}
